 ('Disaster resilience','Adrian Schrinner: local disaster group. Tracy Davis: preparedness and SES coordination.','Ann Leahy: recovery and volunteers. Dan Purdie: emergency management and SES.','Kristy McBain: Emergency Management, with NEMA.'),
